#: appinstaller.rs:119
msgid "This file is not an app that can be installed here (.deb, .flatpak, .flatpakref or AppImage)."
msgstr "Ní aip é an comhad seo is féidir a shuiteáil anseo (.deb, .flatpak, .flatpakref nó AppImage)."

#: appinstaller.rs:134
msgid "This app is made for {arch} computers and does not work on this one (x86-64)."
msgstr "Rinneadh an aip seo do ríomhairí {arch} agus ní oibríonn sí ar an gceann seo (x86-64)."

#: appinstaller.rs:320
msgid "The file could not be read. It may be damaged."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an comhad a léamh. D'fhéadfadh sé a bheith damáistithe."

