msgstr "Tá léiriú an nuashonraithe neamhbhailí."

#: util.rs:167
msgid "The passphrase is not correct, or the encrypted partition cannot be opened."
msgstr "Níl an frása faire ceart, nó ní féidir an deighilt chriptithe a oscailt."

